' Report on Options for Broader Reform of the Institutional Framework for Sustainable Development (IFSD): Structural, Legal, and Financial Aspects (New York: UN Department of Economic and Social Affairs, 2011), available at http://www.uncsd2012.org/rio20/index.php?page=view&type=400&nr=211&menu=45 (last access 20 Dec. 2011). 14 Rio + 20: Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). A Proposal from the Governments of Colombia and Guatemala. Undated (2011). On file with author.",8,True,SUGGEST_REJECT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: appears to be bibliographic/administrative text rather than substantive discussion of legitimacy; treat as noise unless context warrants.,173fe6145a,Greening the United Nations charter World politics in the anthropocene,,
