roaches to complex problems, allow for 10 For a fuller analysis of the “competencies” of different actors and RSS schemes, see Abbott and Snidal (2009a). International regulation without international government: Improving IO performance... 323",5,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as participation; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,cfbb3fc78b,International regulation without international government- Improving IO performance through orchestration Abott&Snidar,,10.1007/s11558-010-9092-3
