ng with uprooted populations. Within a region there can also exist a similar pooling of effortsÐ for example, ConcertacioÂn links development NGOs in ® ve Central American countries. 366",10,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as effectiveness; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,036da53213,Pluralising global governance Analytical approaches and dimensions,,10.1080/01436599550035951
