ny moving parts.43 Greater collaboration among the various 368",2,False,SUGGEST_REVIEW,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as effectiveness; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,036da53213,Pluralising global governance Analytical approaches and dimensions,,10.1080/01436599550035951
