riptions are implemented by states acting within the normative framework of the respective regime.",9,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Definition/Identification,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as effectiveness; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,e11d4d2c26,The Politics of International Environmental Management,,
