hem inadequate to meet the environmental challenges of the 21st century. The main 168 B. H. Desai",8,True,SUGGEST_REJECT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: appears to be bibliographic/administrative text rather than substantive discussion of compliance; treat as noise unless context warrants.,098b9c5a90,The Quest for a United Nations Specialised Agency for the Environment,,10.1080/00358533.2012.661528
