ders, can become a pivot for global climate governance, based on effective multilateralism and achieving sustainable develop ment goals. Strategic Analysis 487",6,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Substantiation/References,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as rule of law; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,df399f5d19,The United Nations and Global Environmental Governance Rajeesh Kumar2020,,10.1080/09700161.2020.1824462
