he generation of national strategies: J Carew-Reid, R Prescott-Allen, S Bass and B Dalal-Clayton, Strategies for National Sustainable Development: A Handbook for their Implementation (1994) prepared by IUCN in collaboration with the International Institute of Environment and Development. 2""NCED, above n 7, para 38.22(1).",7,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as compliance; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,34ae127a5b,The globalisation of environmental law- the role of the United Nations,,
