tnerships of governments, non-governmental organisations and the",11,False,SUGGEST_ACCEPT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Explanation/Elaboration,Draft memo: relevant discussion tagged as participation; verify alignment with theme definition and adjust tag if the construct boundary is better captured elsewhere.,5ac0de18b9,Theorising Global Environmental Governance Key Findings and Future Questions,,10.1177/0305829814561773
