cy and fairness in GEG.56",12,True,SUGGEST_REJECT,PENDING,,Full corpus Pass 2 (synonym-expanded) — remaining documents,Definition/Identification,Draft memo: appears to be bibliographic/administrative text rather than substantive discussion of legitimacy; treat as noise unless context warrants.,5ac0de18b9,Theorising Global Environmental Governance Key Findings and Future Questions,,10.1177/0305829814561773
